<title>USA: Intimate Brands comfortable with Q4 estimate.</title>
<headline>Intimate Brands comfortable with Q4 estimate.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intimate Brands Inc said Thursday it remains comfortable with Wall Street expectations for fourth quarter earnings growth of at least 20 percent.</p>
<p>The First Call consensus earnings estimate for the quarter is $0.63 per share, up from $0.52 a year earlier.</p>
<p>Intimate Brands sells intimate apparel and personal care products through Victoria's Secret, Bath &amp; Body Works, Cacique and Penhaligon's stores, as well as through the Victoria's Secret catalogue.</p>
</text>
